{
    "background_story": "Halo was an angel known for her ability to convey the deepest meaning of words. As a messenger of the divine, she was tasked with delivering sacred texts to the mortal realm. Halo's words were like rays of light, illuminating the true essence of the messages she carried. Her voice was like music, and her presence was accompanied by an aura of clarity. When she spoke, the denotative meaning of each word shone through, untainted by personal biases or emotions. Halo's gift allowed her to convey complex ideas with simplicity and precision, making her a revered figure among the angelic host. Her name, Halo, was a testament to the radiant light of understanding she brought to all who listened to her words.",
